---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="LibreFit - Let's build it together"
  description="Discover how you can improve LibreFit."
  canonical="/donate"
>
  <div class="content-card">
    <h1 class="md-typescale-display-small bold">Let's build it together ❤️</h1>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      LibreFit is a passion project, built by one person who believes software should be open,
      simple, beautiful, and above all, respectful of your privacy.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      I pour countless hours into designing, coding, and refining every detail to create the best
      possible experience. It's a commitment to you, the user, and to a better digital world.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      LibreFit is only possible with your support, whether by donating or by contributing to code
      or translations. Check <a href="https://github.com/LibreFitOrg/LibreFit/CONTRIBUTING.md">GitHub</a> to know how to contribute to the project. If you want to donate instead, see below.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-title-medium">
      All donators and contributors get the supporter version and a credit in the app and on GitHub.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <!-- Section: Donate (h2 — the h1 is the page title above) -->
    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-large bold">Donate</h2>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      If you want to send a message to appreciate/comment/request alongside your donation, visit the
      <a href="/contact.html">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h3 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Direct donation</h3>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      Direct donations are tricky to track (so <b>no supporter code</b> and no credit) but they
      provide the greatest privacy, minimal fees and no minimum amount. Monero address below:
    </p>

    <pre>842RPDZ851EitDZZxCEp1sjjyDpsaV74xAJBTPU6X7TrDAbpDrjq5rRfaF3Q8PnXyQeUYs2xLoxFpZb7ZpSJxBvdDgFVpww</pre>

    <h3 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Integrated processor</h3>

    <form action="/donations/create" method="POST" class="grid gap-4">
      <p class="m-0 md-typescale-body-large">
        You will be redirected to <a href="https://trocador.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trocador</a> to complete your donation with the cryptocurrency of your choice.
      </p>

      <div class="grid gap-2">
        <label for="username" class="md-typescale-title-small">
          Name/username/alias for the credit (optional)
        </label>
        <input type="text" id="username" name="username" class="md-text-field" placeholder="e.g., janedoe — with GitHub username, website or email">
        <p class="m-0 md-typescale-body-small text-on-surface-variant">
          Used to credit you in README.md and LibreFit's about screen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 -my-3 cursor-pointer" for="use-xmr">
        <input type="checkbox" id="use-xmr" name="use-xmr" class="md-checkbox !my-0">
        <span class="md-typescale-body-large">I want to use Monero</span>
      </label>

      <p class="m-0 md-typescale-title-medium">
        To request your supporter code, save immediately your DONATION ID when it's shown.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-2 flex justify-center">
        <button type="submit" class="md-filled-button w-full sm:w-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">volunteer_activism</span>
          Donate crypto
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <hr>

    <!-- Section: Supporter code (h2) with subsections (h3) -->
    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-large bold">Get supporter code</h2>

    <h3 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Donators</h3>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">Once you have donated, insert your DONATION ID to receive your supporter code.</p>

    <form action="/donations/status" method="GET" class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="grid gap-2">
        <label for="id" class="md-typescale-title-small">DONATION ID</label>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="id"
          name="id"
          placeholder="e.g., c02831c7-0de2-474b-84ca-9d622cec062b"
          required
          maxlength="36"
          minlength="36"
          title="Enter a valid ID with UUID v4 format"
          pattern="[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-4[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}"
          class="md-text-field"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <button type="submit" class="md-filled-button w-full sm:w-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">receipt_long</span>
          Check donation status
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <h3 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Contributors</h3>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">Once your pull request is merged, login below with your GitHub account to receive your supporter code.</p>

    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <a href="/contributors/login" class="md-outlined-button w-full sm:w-auto">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">login</span>
        GitHub login
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>